	"notes": {
		"rationale": "A phraseme's Constituents are the biggest units strictly inside its wording, so the Locution zu Hause is one part (ADR 0050). fühlen is lexically reflexive here: in the state sense (DWDS ⟨sich fühlen⟩) no other object can stand in place of sich, so sich and fühlen are two pieces linking to VERB sich fühlen (round-1 Q10, #1278). Comparison wie before a phrase is CCONJ (de/relative-w-adverb-fills-a-slot)."
